    "author": "@joptsy",
    "text": "This whole story made me cry so bad bc it reminded me of the time when I had an online friend that felt like this video felt for pics, I used to send him lots of dms even tho I knew he couldn't answer them bc he just used that platform when he remembered, and one day he told me he felt bad for me doing it when I didn't ask anything in return, I just felt good sending him messages even tho I knew he wouldn't answer. When I stopped doing it I felt empty a while but more than anything bc I felt I was bothering him with that lot of messages. It meant a lot to me, his acc is now deleted and all I have left is the chat with the \"deleted user\" and the few unread messages I last wrote him.",
