    "author": "@gay_madilynn",
    "text": "picsmics has been commenting on this video for about 94% of my own life which is wild to me; as I was growing from a baby to my junior year of highschool, this person kept coming back to this video to leave their thoughts even to this day, and finally here i am\nwhich of us has grown more in the past 15 years? my father passed away as well, although that was 8-9 years ago. while picsmics changed and matured as a person, i gained consciousness to become a person and over time discovered who i am and, just in the last 3-4 years, have gone through a lot to figure out who i am as a person.\ntheir life has been seemingly looking up; even though they lost their dog in a car accident which would be a lot to deal with, their life has gotten better overall with their job and everything.\ni cant say the same. it's basically been downhill since my father passed away. we're struggling for money, our house is literally falling apart, my family fights often... it's livable, but things could be considerably better.\n\nall i can hope is that both of our lives start to look up for the better. it shouldnt be hard for picsmics, but it may not be so easy for me and my family.\nanyways that sure was me venting about things",
    "time": "2 years ago"
