    "author": "@mayureshphansikar",
    "text": "11/1/2023\n\nJust want to remember the day I learned about the legendary picmics from Shaiivalley's video. If you ever read this, picmics, i want to thank you for inspiring me to keep going no matter how difficult life gets. Hope you are doing well!",
