    "author": "@picsmics4",
    "text": "What a ride it's been!   Thank you again everyone for your continued love and encouragement.  \n\nThis has been tremendous for me, I come in as often as I can and read every single comment.  I love you all and hope you can share with one another the same kind of support you have so kindly shared with me.\n\nLife's been a little rough recently - sadly I lost my dog in a car accident a couple weeks back and have been pretty down.  This isn't the first pet I had in my life but it is the first one I sent away in my own arms.   I still wake up in the night because I saw my dog in my dream :(\n\nI know the pain will dull over time.  It almost always does to a certain degree, but I also know it will never fully heal.  \n\nBut you all have been nothing but loving here.  I thank you for that.",
    "time": "2 years ago"
